UCS|HX)-FI-62' and ds1_SourceObjectType = 'network.Element'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2024-02-29T12:22:06.846Z", "DatePublished": "2020-07-28T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2020-07-28T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco has announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS 6200 Series Fabric Interconnects and select UCS accessories. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on End-of-Life announcement. The last day to receive applicable service and support is May 31, 2024.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-b-series-blade-servers/eos-eol-notice-c51-742066.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.448Z", "Moid": "65e076ee6f636b390172465a", "Name": "Last Date of Support for Cisco UCS 6200 Series Fabric Interconnects and select UCS accessories is past", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "Customers currently running Cisco UCS 6200 Series Fabric Interconnects and mentioned Accessories should upgrade to Cisco UCS 6400 Series Fabric Interconnects or later hardware.\n- Cisco UCS Fabric Interconnects Data Sheets can be found [here.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/servers-unified-computing/fabric-interconnects.html#~resources)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.html.](http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/prod_warranties_listing.html.](http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/prod_warranties_listing.html)\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/cisco/support/notifications.html.](http://www.cisco.com/cisco/support/notifications.html)", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "critical", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.448Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "network.Element", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds1_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds1 where ( datediff(current_date(), '2019-03-01' ) >= 0 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2019-03-01T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The date the document that announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life of a product is distributed to the general public.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Life Announcement Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2019-05-31T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to order the product through Cisco point-of-sale mechanisms. The product is no longer for sale after this date.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Sale Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2019-08-29T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last-possible ship date that can be requested of Cisco and/or its contract manufacturers. Actual ship date is dependent on lead time.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Ship Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2020-05-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last-possible date a routine failure analysis may be performed to determine the cause of hardware product failure or defect.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Routine Failure Analysis Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2020-05-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "For equipment and software that is not covered by a service-and-support con