HX)-FI-62' and ds1_SourceObjectType = 'network.Element'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2023-03-10T08:06:56.717Z", "DatePublished": "2019-03-01T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2020-07-28T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS 6200 Series Fabric Interconnects And Select Unified Computing Systems Accessories. The last day to order the affected product(s) is May 31, 2019. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) as per EoL announcement", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-b-series-blade-servers/eos-eol-notice-c51-742066.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.416Z", "Moid": "640ae5206f636b2d39dc6a29", "Name": "End-of-Life Announcement for Cisco UCS 6200 Series Fabric Interconnects and select UCS accessories", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "Customers currently running Cisco UCS 6200 Series Fabric Interconnects and mentioned Accessories should upgrade to Cisco UCS 6400 Series Fabric Interconnects or later hardware.\n- Cisco UCS Fabric Interconnects Data Sheets can be found [here.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/servers-unified-computing/fabric-interconnects.html#~resources)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.htm