dOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2026-08-04T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The date the document that announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life of a product is distributed to the general public.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "info", "MilestoneType": "endOfLifeAnnouncementDate", "Name": "End of Life(EOL) Announcement Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi350x-eol-info", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(MI350X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-08-27T04:47:01.22Z", "DatePublished": "2026-08-04T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-08-20T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI350X GPUs. The last day to order the affected product(s) is October 15, 2026. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-amd-mi350x-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.061Z", "Moid": "6a8fc1456f636b3901ae1c6e", "Name": "End-of-Sale and End-of-Life Announcement for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI350X GPUs", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the AMD MI350X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or planning deployments with this platform are encouraged to migrate to Cisco's latest accelerated computing solution, delivering enhanced AI performance, scalability, and operational efficiency. Customers considering AMD MI350X-based deployments should evaluate transitioning into the Cisco UCS C845A to benefit from next-generation performance and long-term architectural scalability. The Cisco UCS C845A platform, powered by AMD Instinct\u2122 MI350P GPUs and AMD Pensando Pollara 400G NIC, leverages the cutting-edge AMD CDNA\u2122 4 architecture to deliver a significant leap in computational power, specifically engineered to handle the most demanding generative AI and high-performance computing (HPC) workloads. The platform provides enhanced AI training and inference performance, high-bandwidth HBM3E memory, an open enterprise-ready ROCm\u2122 software stack, and simplified deployment within existing infrastructure. By transitioning to this platform, organizations gain a robust, scalable foundation that is purpose-built to evolve alongside the rapidly changing landscape of AI and HPC, ensuring long-term investment protection and sustained performance gains.\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.061Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) >= -180 and datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) < -90 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": -90, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "lastDateOfSupport", "Name": "Last Date Of Support(LDOS) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -180}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-ldos-upcoming", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.985Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The last date of (hardware) support for the affected product(s) is June 30, 2029. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.028Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef3768", "Name": "Last Date of Support for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:45.028Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) >= 0 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "past", "MilestoneType": "lastDateOfSupport", "Name": "Last Date Of Support(LDOS) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-ldos-past", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.954Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The last date of (hardware) support for the affected product(s) was June 30, 2029.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.996Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef3763", "Name": "Last Date of Support for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is past", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "critical", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.996Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) >= -90 and datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) < -30 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": -30, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "lastDateOfSupport", "Name": "Last Date Of Support(LDOS) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -90}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-ldos-medium", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.924Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The last date of (hardware) support for the affected product(s) is June 30, 2029. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.964Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef375e", "Name": "Last Date of Support for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "medium", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.964Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) >= -365 and datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) < -180 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": -180, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "lastDateOfSupport", "Name": "Last Date Of Support(LDOS) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -365}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-ldos-info", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.895Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The last date of (hardware) support for the affected product(s) is June 30, 2029. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.938Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef3758", "Name": "Last Date of Support for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.938Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) >= -30 and datediff(current_date(), '2029-06-30' ) < 0 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 0, "LabelHint": "imminent", "MilestoneType": "lastDateOfSupport", "Name": "Last Date Of Support(LDOS) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -30}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-ldos-critical", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.864Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The last date of (hardware) support for the affected product(s) is June 30, 2029. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.909Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef3753", "Name": "Last Date of Support for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is imminent", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "critical", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.909Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) >= -180 and datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) < -90 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": -90, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "endOfSoftwareMaintenanceDate", "Name": "End of SW Maintenance Releases(EOSM) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -180}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-eosm-upcoming", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.835Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The end of software maintenance releases date for the affected product(s) is June 25, 2027. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.878Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef374d", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.878Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) >= -90 and datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) < -30 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": -30, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "endOfSoftwareMaintenanceDate", "Name": "End of SW Maintenance Releases(EOSM) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -90}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-eosm-medium", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.806Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The end of software maintenance releases date for the affected product(s) is June 25, 2027. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.843Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef3747", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "medium", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.843Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) >= -365 and datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) < -180 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": -180, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "endOfSoftwareMaintenanceDate", "Name": "End of SW Maintenance Releases(EOSM) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -365}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-eosm-info", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.779Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The end of software maintenance releases date for the affected product(s) is June 25, 2027. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.811Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef3742", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.811Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) >= -30 and datediff(current_date(), '2027-06-25' ) < 0 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": 0, "LabelHint": "imminent", "MilestoneType": "endOfSoftwareMaintenanceDate", "Name": "End of SW Maintenance Releases(EOSM) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -30}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-eosm-critical", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-07-07T10:59:10.745Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The end of software maintenance releases date for the affected product(s) is June 25, 2027. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.78Z", "Moid": "6a4cdbfe6f636b3901ef373d", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs is imminent", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "critical", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.78Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.RackUnit", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds2_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds2 JOIN ds1 ON ds1.ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid = ds2.ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid where ( datediff(current_date(), '2026-05-25' ) >= 0 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The date the document that announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life of a product is distributed to the general public.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Life Announcement Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2026-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to order the product through Cisco point-of-sale mechanisms. The product is no longer for sale after this date.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Sale Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2027-06-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date that Cisco Engineering may release any final software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After this date, Cisco Engineering will no longer develop, repair, maintain, or test the product software.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Software Maintenance Releases Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2029-06-30T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Hardware) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The date the document that announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life of a product is distributed to the general public.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "info", "MilestoneType": "endOfLifeAnnouncementDate", "Name": "End of Life(EOL) Announcement Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "UCS C885A M8"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-c885a-m8-rack-mi300x-h200-eol-info", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "graphicsCard", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE '(H200.*|MI300X.*)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}, {"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds2", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds2_Moid, ds2_AccountMoid, ds2_DomainGroupMoid, ds2_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds2_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds2_Model FROM ds2 WHERE ds2_Model RLIKE '(UCSC.*885A.*M8)'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-06-09T16:48:38.57Z", "DatePublished": "2026-05-25T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-06-03T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs. The last day to order the affected product(s) is June 25, 2026. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-rs-nvidia-hgx-h200-gpus-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.746Z", "Moid": "6a2843e66f636b39011645c5", "Name": "End-of-Sale and End-of-Life Announcement for the Cisco UCS C885A M8 Rack Servers with AMD MI300X and NVIDIA HGX H200 GPUs", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "As part of our product lifecycle management, the NVIDIA H200 and AMD MI300X GPU-based offerings are being transitioned out of the portfolio. Customers evaluating or currently planning deployments with these platforms are encouraged to consider the latest generation of accelerated computing solutions designed to deliver enhanced AI performance, scalability, and efficiency.\n\nCustomers currently evaluating NVIDIA H200 or AMD MI300X based deployments should consider the following next-generation GPU platforms based on workload requirements, architectural preferences, and commercial considerations:\n\n- **UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs**, delivering significant advancements in AI training and inference performance, memory bandwidth, and scalability for large-scale accelerated computing environments.\n- **UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs**, offering enhanced compute density, improved performance per watt, and strong capabilities for modern AI, HPC and data-intensive workloads.\n\nThese next-generation platforms provide customers with flexible upgrade options while enabling adoption of the latest innovations in GPU architecture and accelerated infrastructure design.\n\nFor detailed specifications and architectural considerations, please refer to the latest product datasheets:\n\n- [UCS C880A M8 with NVIDIA HGX Blackwell Ultra B300 GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c880a-m8-rack-server-ds.html)\n- [UCS C885A M8 with AMD Instinct MI350X GPUs](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-c-series-rack-servers/ucs-c885a-m8-ds.html)\n\nCustomers may be able to use the Cisco Takeback and Reuse Program where applicable to return hardware that has reached end-of-use, at no cost. Returned products are put to their next best use, whether reused, remanufactured, or recycled by one of Cisco's certified contracted recyclers. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse.html).\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/about/takeback-and-reuse/product-recycling.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html).\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html).\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications).", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.746Z"}
