B420|B260|B460|EX).*M4.*' and ds1_SourceObjectType = 'compute.Blade'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2024-03-04T10:22:39.394Z", "DatePublished": "2018-08-16T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2018-09-06T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco has announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco Unified Computing System B-Series M4 Blade Servers (B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4 and B460 M4). Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on End of Life announcement. The last day to receive applicable service and support is February 29, 2024.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-b-series-blade-servers/eos-eol-notice-c51-741236.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.063Z", "Moid": "65e5a0ef6f636b390176db09", "Name": "Last Date of Support for Cisco UCS B-Series M4 Blade Servers (B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4 and B460 M4) is past", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "Customers currently running Cisco UCS B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4 and B460 M4 hardware should upgrade to Cisco UCS B-Series M5 or later hardware.\n- Cisco UCS B-Series Blade Servers Data Sheets can be found [here.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/servers-unified-computing/ucs-b-series-blade-servers/datasheet-listing.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.html.](http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/prod_warranties_listing.html.](http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/prod_warranties_listing.html)\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/cisco/support/notifications.html.](http://www.cisco.com/cisco/support/notifications.html)", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "critical", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.063Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "compute.Blade", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds1_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds1 where ( datediff(current_date(), '2018-08-16' ) >= 0 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2018-08-16T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The date the document that announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life of a product is distributed to the general public.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Life Announcement Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2019-02-14T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to order the product through Cisco point-of-sale mechanisms. The product is no longer for sale after this date.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Sale Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2020-02-14T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last-possible date a routine failure analysis may be performed to determine the cause of hardware product failure or defect.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Routine Failure Analysis Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2020-02-14T00:00:00Z", "Description": "For equipment and software that is not covered by a service-and-support contract, this is the last date to order a new service-and-support contract or add the equipment and/or software to an existing service-and-support contract.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of New Service Attachment Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2023-05-12T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to extend or renew a service contract for the product.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "End of Service Contract Renewal Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, {"Date": "2024-02-29T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of Support Hardware", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2018-08-16T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The date the document that announces the end-of-sale and end-of-life of a product is distributed to the general public.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "info", "MilestoneType": "endOfLifeAnnouncementDate", "Name": "End of Life(EOL) Announcement Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4, B460 M4"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-b-series-m4-eol-info", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "computePhysicalSummary", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model FROM ds1 WHERE ds1_Model RLIKE 'UCS.*(B200|B420|B260|B460|EX).*M4.*' and ds1_SourceObjectType = 'compute.Blade'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2023-03-10T08:06:56.591Z", "DatePublished": "2018-08-16T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2018-09-06T00:00:00Z", "Description": "Cisco has announced the end-of-sale and end-of-life dates for the Cisco Unified Computing System B-Series Blade Servers (B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4 and B460 M4). The last day to order the affected product(s) was February 14, 2019. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) based on EoL bulletin.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-b-series-blade-servers/eos-eol-notice-c51-741236.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.008Z", "Moid": "640ae5206f636b2d39dc6a17", "Name": "End-of-Life Announcement for Cisco UCS B-Series Blade Servers (B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4 and B460 M4)", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "Customers may be able to continue to purchase the Cisco Unified Computing System B-Series Blade Servers (B200 M4, B420 M4, B260 M4 and B460 M4) through the Cisco Certified Refurbished Equipment program. For information about the Cisco Certified Refurbished Equipment program, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/go/eos.](https://www.cisco.com/go/eos)\n\nThe Cisco Takeback and Recycle program helps businesses properly dispose of surplus products that have reached their end of useful life. The program is open to all business users of Cisco equipment and its associated brands and subsidiaries. For more information, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/web/about/ac227/ac228/ac231/about_cisco_takeback_recycling.html.](https://www.cisco.com/web/about/ac227/ac228/ac231/about_cisco_takeback_recycling.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.html.](http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/products_end-of-life_policy.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/prod_warranties_listing.html.](http://www.cisco.com/en/US/products/prod_warranties_listing.html)\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [http://www.cisco.com/cisco/support/notifications.html.](http://www.cisco.com/cisco/support/notifications.html)", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:44.008Z"}
{"AccountMoid": "5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "Actions": [{"AffectedObjectType": "network.Element", "AlertType": "eolAdvisory", "Identifiers": [{"Name": "Moid", "ObjectType": "tam.Identifiers", "Value": "ds1_Moid"}], "Name": "", "ObjectType": "tam.Action", "OperationType": "create", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds2", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT * FROM ds1 where ( datediff(current_date(), '2030-12-31' ) >= -180 and datediff(current_date(), '2030-12-31' ) < -90 )"}], "Type": "restApi"}], "AdvisoryDetails": {"AllMilestones": [{"Date": "2030-12-31T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete.", "EndOffset": 2147483647, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "unknown", "Name": "Last Date of (Software) Support", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": 0}], "Description": "", "Milestone": {"Date": "2030-12-31T00:00:00Z", "Description": "The last date to receive applicable service and support for the product as entitled by active service contracts or by warranty terms and conditions. After this date, all support services for the product are unavailable, and the product becomes obsolete", "EndOffset": -90, "LabelHint": "upcoming", "MilestoneType": "lastDateOfSupport", "Name": "Last Date Of Support(LDOS) Date", "ObjectType": "tam.Milestone", "StartOffset": -180}, "ObjectType": "tam.EolAdvisoryDetails", "Release": "6.0"}, "AdvisoryId": "ucs-6.0-ldos-upcoming", "Ancestors": [], "ApiDataSources": [{"MoType": "networkElementSummary", "Name": "ds1", "ObjectType": "tam.ApiDataSource", "Queries": [{"Name": "qds1", "ObjectType": "tam.QueryEntry", "Priority": 1, "Query": "SELECT ds1_Moid, ds1_AccountMoid, ds1_DomainGroupMoid, ds1_RegisteredDevice.Moid as ds1_RegisteredDeviceMoid, ds1_Model, ds1_Version, ds1_BundleVersion FROM ds1 WHERE (ds1_Version RLIKE '^6\\\\.0' OR ds1_BundleVersion RLIKE '^6\\\\.0') and ds1_SourceObjectType = 'network.Element' and ds1_ManagementMode = 'UCSM'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-09-17T03:33:53.232Z", "DatePublished": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z", "Description": "**EOL15977**\n\nCisco has announced the end-of-sale and end-of life dates for the Cisco UCS Manager Release 6.0. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) as per End of Life announcement. The last day to receive service and support for this release is December 31, 2030.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-manager/ucs-manager-release-6-0-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:43.973Z", "Moid": "6aab5fa16f636b39010c364c", "Name": "Last Date of Support for Cisco UCS Manager Release 6.0 is upcoming", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "**Product Migration Options**\n\nAfter December 31, 2028, M7- and M8-generation servers that remain managed by Cisco UCS Manager will no longer be eligible for new software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After December 31, 2030, M7- and M8-generation servers that remain managed by Cisco UCS Manager will no longer be eligible for Cisco UCS Manager support or security vulnerability fixes. Cisco provides the Intersight Managed Mode Transition Tool to assist customers in migrating from UCS Manager to Intersight Managed Mode.\n\nFor additional information related to the UCS Manager End-of-Sale and End-of-Life, please refer to the FAQs here: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-manager/ucs-manager-eol-faq.html.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-manager/ucs-manager-eol-faq.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Intersight Managed Mode Transition Tool, go to: [Cisco Intersight Managed Mode Transition Tool User Guide.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/unified_computing/Intersight/IMM-Transition-Tool/User-Guide-5-0/b_imm_transition_tool_user_guide_5_0/m_overview_imm_tt_5_0.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html)\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications.](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications)", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "info", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:43.973Z"}
