BundleVersion RLIKE '^6\\\\.0') and ds1_SourceObjectType = 'network.Element' and ds1_ManagementMode = 'UCSM'"}], "Type": "intersightApi"}], "CreateTime": "2026-09-17T03:33:53.203Z", "DatePublished": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z", "DateUpdated": "2026-09-15T00:00:00Z", "Description": "**EOL15977**\n\nCisco has announced the end-of-sale and end-of life dates for the Cisco UCS Manager Release 6.0. Customers with active service contracts will continue to receive support from the Cisco Technical Assistance Center (TAC) as per End of Life announcement. The last day to receive service and support for this release was December 31, 2030.", "DomainGroupMoid": "5b2541877a7662743465cc89", "ExecuteOnPod": "tier1", "ExternalUrl": "https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-manager/ucs-manager-release-6-0-eol.html", "ModTime": "2026-09-18T18:16:43.938Z", "Moid": "6aab5fa16f636b39010c3647", "Name": "Last Date of Support for Cisco UCS Manager Release 6.0 is past", "ObjectType": "tam.AdvisoryDefinition", "Organization": {"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}, "OtherRefUrls": [], "Owners": ["5960901ca94eba000127e33a", "shared"], "PermissionResources": [{"Moid": "5dde9f896972652d3353a082", "ObjectType": "organization.Organization", "link": "https://intersight.com/api/v1/organization/Organizations/5dde9f896972652d3353a082"}], "Recommendation": "**Product Migration Options**\n\nAfter December 31, 2028, M7- and M8-generation servers that remain managed by Cisco UCS Manager will no longer be eligible for new software maintenance releases or bug fixes. After December 31, 2030, M7- and M8-generation servers that remain managed by Cisco UCS Manager will no longer be eligible for Cisco UCS Manager support or security vulnerability fixes. Cisco provides the Intersight Managed Mode Transition Tool to assist customers in migrating from UCS Manager to Intersight Managed Mode.\n\nFor additional information related to the UCS Manager End-of-Sale and End-of-Life, please refer to the FAQs here: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-manager/ucs-manager-eol-faq.html.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/collateral/servers-unified-computing/ucs-manager/ucs-manager-eol-faq.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Intersight Managed Mode Transition Tool, go to: [Cisco Intersight Managed Mode Transition Tool User Guide.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/unified_computing/Intersight/IMM-Transition-Tool/User-Guide-5-0/b_imm_transition_tool_user_guide_5_0/m_overview_imm_tt_5_0.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco End-of-Life Policy, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/eos-eol-policy.html)\n\nFor more information about the Cisco Product Warranties, go to: [https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html.](https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/products/warranty-listing.html)\n\nTo subscribe to receive end-of-life/end-of-sale information, go to: [https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications.](https://cway.cisco.com/mynotifications)", "S3DataSources": [], "Severity": {"Level": "critical", "ObjectType": "tam.EolSeverity"}, "SharedScope": "shared", "State": "ready", "Tags": [], "Type": "eolAdvisory", "Version": "1.0", "Workaround": "", "account_name": "MAPLE", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T18:16:43.938Z"}
